		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "38339589",
		"description": "Seneca AI REST API.\n\nVariables: set `HOST` and `X-SENECA-AI-API-KEY` (collection variables or an environment). `USER_ID` is sent as `X-SENECA-AI-USER-ID` in the conversation requests. `CONVERSATION_ID`, `ACCESS_TOKEN` and `REFRESH_TOKEN` are filled in automatically by the *create conversation* and *login* requests.\n\nSwagger: {{HOST}}/apidocs"
	},
	"item": [
